{
    "title": "MISTPLAY: Play to Earn Money",
    "description": "<b>Join Mistplay to fetch rewards that go beyond the game \ud83c\udfae Earn money playing games you\u2019ll love.</b>\r\n\r\n1\ufe0f\u20e3 Explore games like Words with Friends or rediscover old favorites like Solitaire and Merge Dragons.\r\n2\ufe0f\u20e3 The more you play, the more units you earn in app for rewards.\r\n3\ufe0f\u20e3 Cash out money for gift cards to PayPal, DoorDash, Sephora, Walmart, and more!*\r\n\r\n<b>Our story: The best-kept secret in gaming \u26a1</b>\r\nSince launching in 2016, we\u2019ve already given out more than $100 million USD** worth of rewards and gift cards to over two million users. Get rewarded and earn gift cards for playing Words with Friends, Solitaire, Merge Dragons, and others!\r\n\r\nSelect the games that interest you to earn money for your playtime. Reach checkpoints in app to redeem units for gift cards. Cash out rewards for real gift cards to PayPal, Sephora, Walmart, and many others!\r\n\r\nEarn money for playing Words With Friends to use at Sephora. Enjoy Solitaire and cash out with a gift card to Walmart! Level up in Merge Dragons and grab your next PayPal gift card.\r\n\r\n<b>Start your earning journey \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f</b>\r\n\ud83c\udfae Discover a curated games list just for you, featuring titles like Merge Dragons, and Solitaire to name a few!\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 Download games directly through the Mistplay app, like Words with Friends.\r\n\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Just play to get rewarded units and earn money.\r\n\ud83c\udf81 Redeem the units you earn for gift cards in the Shop to Sephora and PayPal, among others.\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Fetch badges along the way to earn even more money and cash out for gift cards.\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Keep your Daily Streak going to earn weekly bonuses.\r\n\ud83d\ude80 Enter sweepstakes and join exclusive events for more money rewards.\r\n\ud83c\udfb2 Earn 200 free units toward your first gift card by downloading today and get rewarded for your playtime. \r\n\ud83d\udecd\ufe0fCash out gift cards from Mistplay to spend on PayPal, DoorDash, Sephora, Walmart, and more!\r\n\r\nJust play Words With Friends, or Merge Dragons to collect units, and earn money for gift cards to your favorites, like PayPal and Sephora. Get ready to fetch gift cards, earn rewards, and redeem money for your playtime today.\r\n\r\nDon\u2019t wait to get rewarded with gift cards. Earn money and cash out while playing Solitaire, and so many other great games.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Stay up to date \ud83d\udea8</b>\r\nFacebook: [https://www.facebook.com/mistplayapp]\r\nX: [https://twitter.com/mistplayapp]\r\nInstagram: [https://www.instagram.com/mistplay]\r\nBlog: [https://medium.com/mistplay]\r\nYouTube: [https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQ55Bap61Mo0ft4GC144bjQ]\r\n\r\n*The merchants do not endorse and are not affiliated with the Mistplay loyalty program. Brands and trademarks displayed belong to their respective holders. Games shown are for illustrative purposes and may not be available to all users in all regions. \r\n\r\n**Mistplay data as of January 2024.\r\n\r\nContact Support at <u>https://bit.ly/MistplaySupport</u>.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Join Mistplay to fetch rewards that go beyond the game \ud83c\udfae Earn money playing games you\u2019ll love.</b><br><br>1\ufe0f\u20e3 Explore games like Words with Friends or rediscover old favorites like Solitaire and Merge Dragons.<br>2\ufe0f\u20e3 The more you play, the more units you earn in app for rewards.<br>3\ufe0f\u20e3 Cash out money for gift cards to PayPal, DoorDash, Sephora, Walmart, and more!*<br><br><b>Our story: The best-kept secret in gaming \u26a1</b><br>Since launching in 2016, we\u2019ve already given out more than $100 million USD** worth of rewards and gift cards to over two million users. Get rewarded and earn gift cards for playing Words with Friends, Solitaire, Merge Dragons, and others!<br><br>Select the games that interest you to earn money for your playtime. Reach checkpoints in app to redeem units for gift cards. Cash out rewards for real gift cards to PayPal, Sephora, Walmart, and many others!<br><br>Earn money for playing Words With Friends to use at Sephora. Enjoy Solitaire and cash out with a gift card to Walmart! Level up in Merge Dragons and grab your next PayPal gift card.<br><br><b>Start your earning journey \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f</b><br>\ud83c\udfae Discover a curated games list just for you, featuring titles like Merge Dragons, and Solitaire to name a few!<br>\ud83d\udcf1 Download games directly through the Mistplay app, like Words with Friends.<br>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Just play to get rewarded units and earn money.<br>\ud83c\udf81 Redeem the units you earn for gift cards in the Shop to Sephora and PayPal, among others.<br>\ud83c\udf1f Fetch badges along the way to earn even more money and cash out for gift cards.<br>\ud83d\udd25 Keep your Daily Streak going to earn weekly bonuses.<br>\ud83d\ude80 Enter sweepstakes and join exclusive events for more money rewards.<br>\ud83c\udfb2 Earn 200 free units toward your first gift card by downloading today and get rewarded for your playtime. <br>\ud83d\udecd\ufe0fCash out gift cards from Mistplay to spend on PayPal, DoorDash, Sephora, Walmart, and more!<br><br>Just play Words With Friends, or Merge Dragons to collect units, and earn money for gift cards to your favorites, like PayPal and Sephora. Get ready to fetch gift cards, earn rewards, and redeem money for your playtime today.<br><br>Don\u2019t wait to get rewarded with gift cards. Earn money and cash out while playing Solitaire, and so many other great games.<br><br><br><b>Stay up to date \ud83d\udea8</b><br>Facebook: [https://www.facebook.com/mistplayapp]<br>X: [https://twitter.com/mistplayapp]<br>Instagram: [https://www.instagram.com/mistplay]<br>Blog: [https://medium.com/mistplay]<br>YouTube: [https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQ55Bap61Mo0ft4GC144bjQ]<br><br>*The merchants do not endorse and are not affiliated with the Mistplay loyalty program. Brands and trademarks displayed belong to their respective holders. Games shown are for illustrative purposes and may not be available to all users in all regions. <br><br>**Mistplay data as of January 2024.<br><br>Contact Support at <u>https://bit.ly/MistplaySupport</u>.",
